## Photographs

**No photographs of any business are included in this repository**, and the samples are
built so that this is visible rather than hidden. The images a sample needs are fetched
locally by whoever runs it; see `samples/schnackertz/assets/README.md`.

The reason is not caution, it is accuracy. Photographs of a restaurant or a cinema belong
to that business and to whoever took them. An MIT licence covering them would be a false
statement about who may reuse them, and this repository is partly about not making
statements it cannot support.

## The businesses named in the samples

`samples/` contains unsolicited **proposals** for two real businesses, each labelled as a
proposal on the page itself. Neither commissioned the work, neither endorses it, and
neither page is presented as their website. Every fact on them was read from the
business's own public pages on the date recorded in the sample's README, and anything
that could not be read there is marked as missing rather than filled in.
